&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:7.9pt;min-height:7.9pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:9.8pt;padding-right:2.3pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;　北海道ニチモウ㈱&lt;br/&gt;(注)６&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.9pt;padding-right:2.9pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;北海道函館市&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;95,000&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.9pt;padding-right:2.9pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;海洋事業&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;100.00　&lt;br/&gt;(39.22)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:2.6pt;padding-right:2.6pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;ロープ類及び漁網を製造し、販売している。&lt;br/&gt;当社所有の土地、建物を賃貸している。&lt;br/&gt;役員の兼任：１名&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:7.9pt;min-height:7.9pt;"&gt;
